Hi Dan, yes there should be no column names/numbers in the file. The R function "scan" expects a file that is only numbers. The quickest fix would be to delete the column names from the files.
Another option would be to download the file "create_mats.R" from Github, and change the line with "scan" (should be line 267) and add the function argument "skip=1"

Chris

